  "details": "After loading VRchat, my game will always load fine the first time, but then after the first time whenever I try to change avatar, recalibrate FBT, or change worlds, there's about a 60% chance that it turns me into an error robot. It only turns me into a robot on my end, to others I look fine. I will be unable to change avatars or fix it afterwards too, the only fix is completely rebooting the game.\nI have reinstalled vrchat, reinstalled steamVR, completely reinstalled windows on my pc, fresh copy and no saved files. I had someone from my internet company come out and have a look at my system, test all connections, and change the port for the apartment floor that I'm on. I have been in contact with vrchat support who had me test every connection, firewall, and even install something called warp, which did not fix the issue either.",
